- _account_settings_url = web_app_url(anchor: '/account_settings')

:markdown
  ## Your subscription payment for '#{@plan.name}' has failed.

  Your payment for '#{@plan.name}' failed using the following credit card:

  Card No.: #############{@billing_profile.last_four}

  Card Type: #{@billing_profile.card_type}

  Expiry: #{@billing_profile.exp_month}/#{@billing_profile.exp_year}

  If you changed your card recently, please take a moment to [update the card](#{_account_settings_url}) details.

  Note: We will attempt to charge your card 3 times before downgrading your plan.

= mixpanel_pixel_track 'N2O Payment Failed Alert Received', @user.email
